---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About All Masonry Services Inc — 19 Years of Masonry in Chicagoland"
  description="Family-run masonry contractor serving Chicagoland since 2007. 500+ homes. 4.8★ rating. We match mortar, brick, and stone to your original build — so it lasts decades, not seasons."
  canonical="https://allmasonryservices.com/about"
>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-hero" aria-label="About All Masonry Services">
    <div class="ab-hero-inner">
      <div class="ab-hero-badge">
        <span class="ab-badge-dot">✦</span>
        <span>Est. 2007 — Chicagoland</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="ab-hero-h1">
        Every Chicago winter<br />
        <em>tests your masonry.</em><br />
        We make sure it passes.
      </h1>
      <p class="ab-hero-sub">
        All Masonry Services has matched mortar, brick, and stone to original builds across Chicagoland since 2007 — residential, commercial, and everything in between. No subcontractors. No shortcuts. No callbacks.
      </p>
      <div class="ab-hero-stats">
        <div class="ab-stat">
          <span class="ab-stat-num">19+</span>
          <span class="ab-stat-label">Years in Chicagoland</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-stat-div" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ab-stat">
          <span class="ab-stat-num">500+</span>
          <span class="ab-stat-label">Homes &amp; Buildings Restored</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-stat-div" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ab-stat">
          <span class="ab-stat-num">4.8★</span>
          <span class="ab-stat-label">92 Verified Google Reviews</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-stat-div" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ab-stat">
          <span class="ab-stat-num">0</span>
          <span class="ab-stat-label">Callbacks on Record</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE PROBLEM WE SOLVE
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-problem" aria-labelledby="ab-problem-h2">
    <div class="ab-problem-inner">
      <div class="ab-problem-left">
        <div class="ab-section-label">
          <span class="ab-label-dot">✦</span>
          <span>Why It Matters</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="ab-problem-h2" id="ab-problem-h2">
          Chicagoland gets 100+ freeze-thaw cycles per year.<br />
          <strong>Cheap mortar fails in 2–3 seasons.</strong>
        </h2>
        <p class="ab-problem-body">
          When water gets into a hairline crack, it freezes, expands, and widens that crack every single winter. A $200 tuckpointing job done with the wrong mortar becomes a $2,000 structural repair in five years. Most contractors don't match mortar type, joint depth, or brick color to your original masonry — they just fill it and move on.
        </p>
        <p class="ab-problem-body">
          We don't. Every project starts with a mortar analysis — ASTM C87, C270, and C476 compliance — so what we install performs the same way your original masonry does. The repair blends in. The joint holds. You don't call us back.
        </p>
        <div class="ab-problem-proof">
          <div class="ab-proof-item">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 10L8 14L16 6" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Mortar matched to original — composition, color, joint depth</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-proof-item">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 10L8 14L16 6" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
            <span>ASTM-compliant materials on every single job — tested, not assumed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-proof-item">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 10L8 14L16 6" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Our own licensed crew — no subcontractors, ever</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-proof-item">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 10L8 14L16 6" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Licensed &amp; insured in Illinois — verifiable on request</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-problem-right" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="ab-problem-visual">
          <div class="ab-visual-card ab-visual-card--top">
            <p class="ab-visual-label">Wrong mortar type</p>
            <p class="ab-visual-value ab-visual-value--bad">Fails in 2–3 seasons</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-visual-divider">
            <div class="ab-visual-vs">VS</div>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-visual-card ab-visual-card--bottom">
            <p class="ab-visual-label">ASTM-matched mortar</p>
            <p class="ab-visual-value ab-visual-value--good">Holds for decades</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-visual-footnote">All Masonry Services standard on every job since 2007</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
       OUR STORY
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-story" aria-labelledby="ab-story-h2">
    <div class="ab-story-inner">
      <div class="ab-section-label ab-section-label--gold">
        <span class="ab-label-dot">✦</span>
        <span>Our Story</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="ab-story-h2" id="ab-story-h2">
        We started in 2007 because Chicagoland deserved masonry contractors who actually knew Chicago masonry.
      </h2>
      <div class="ab-story-grid">
        <div class="ab-story-body">
          <p>
            The North Shore has some of the most architecturally varied residential masonry in Illinois — 1920s common brick, 1950s face brick, 1970s block veneer, 2000s limestone façades. Each era used different mortar compositions. Each neighborhood has different exposure patterns. Most contractors treat it all the same.
          </p>
          <p>
            All Masonry Services was built around one principle: the repair should disappear into the original build. Not because it looks the same — because it performs the same. Freeze-thaw, moisture infiltration, thermal expansion — the repaired section has to move the same way the 80-year-old brick around it does. That takes knowledge, not just a trowel.
          </p>
          <p>
            19 years and 500+ projects later, that principle hasn't changed. We work across Chicagoland — Hinsdale, Winnetka, Oak Brook, Naperville, Elmhurst, Evanston, Highland Park — on single-family homes, multi-unit buildings, and commercial facades. The scale changes. The standard doesn't.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-story-milestones">
          <div class="ab-milestone">
            <span class="ab-milestone-year">2007</span>
            <div class="ab-milestone-content">
              <p class="ab-milestone-title">Founded in Chicagoland</p>
              <p class="ab-milestone-desc">Started with residential tuckpointing and brick repair across the North Shore.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-milestone">
            <span class="ab-milestone-year">2010</span>
            <div class="ab-milestone-content">
              <p class="ab-milestone-title">Expanded to commercial masonry</p>
              <p class="ab-milestone-desc">CMU block, facade work, and commercial brick stone added to our scope.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-milestone">
            <span class="ab-milestone-year">2015</span>
            <div class="ab-milestone-content">
              <p class="ab-milestone-title">Custom home masonry</p>
              <p class="ab-milestone-desc">Became the go-to masonry partner for custom home builders across Chicagoland.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-milestone">
            <span class="ab-milestone-year">2026</span>
            <div class="ab-milestone-content">
              <p class="ab-milestone-title">19 years. Same standard.</p>
              <p class="ab-milestone-desc">500+ projects. 4.8★ on Google. 0 callbacks. Still our own crew. Still no shortcuts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

