          <h3 class="ab-trust-title">No Subcontractors — Ever</h3>
          <p class="ab-trust-body">Every person on your project is part of our licensed, trained crew. What we estimate is what we build — not what a sub decides to build that day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-trust-card">
          <div class="ab-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
              <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <path d="M9 14L12.5 17.5L19 11" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/>
