          <h3 class="ab-trust-title">ASTM-Compliant Materials</h3>
          <p class="ab-trust-body">We test mortar to ASTM C87, spec mortar type to ASTM C270, and verify grout to ASTM C476. Not because it's required — because it's the only way to know the repair will hold.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-trust-card">
          <div class="ab-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
              <rect x="4" y="4" width="20" height="20" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <path d="M9 10H19M9 14H16M9 18H13" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ab-trust-title">Written Estimate Before Any Work</h3>
          <p class="ab-trust-body">You get a written scope with materials, methods, and pricing before we touch your property. No verbal promises. No post-job surprises.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-trust-card">
          <div class="ab-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
              <path d="M14 4L16.5 10.5L24 11.3L18.5 16.5L20.2 24L14 20.3L7.8 24L9.5 16.5L4 11.3L11.5 10.5L14 4Z" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="miter"/>
