          <p class="ab-trust-body">92 Google reviews from real Illinois homeowners. Not curated. Not cherry-picked. Every review is attached to a real project address in Chicagoland.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-trust-card">
          <div class="ab-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
              <rect x="6" y="8" width="16" height="16" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <path d="M6 12H22M10 8V6M18 8V6" stroke="#D4A931" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ab-trust-title">Free On-Site Inspection</h3>
          <p class="ab-trust-body">We walk the property before any estimate. What looks like a $300 tuckpointing job might be a $150 repair — or a $1,500 structural issue you need to know about now.</p>
